					<description><![CDATA[<p>Whistleblower exposes all the secret ways that Trina Solar controls T1 Energy. They provided us emails, ERP systems, and account records that confirm it. They explained that T1 Energy is basically a “Shell company” for Trina Solar.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/t1-energy-the-whistleblower-series-part-2-effective-control/">T1 Energy – The Whistleblower Series –– Part 2 –– “A Shell Co for Trina” Whistleblower Shares How Trina Secretly Controls T1 Energy:</a> appeared first on <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com">Fuzzy Panda Research</a>.</p>
]]></description>
		
		
		
