		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/?p=3714</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>T1 executives have been telling investors that it had stopped buying solar cells from Trina Solar, the Chinese solar giant. A whistleblower came forward and shared 26 invoices for solar cell purchases T1 made. They all came from the "Chinese Military Company," Trina Solar.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/t1-energy-te-whistleblower-series-part-1-the-solar-cell-invoices/">T1 Energy (TE) &#8211; Whistleblower Series: Part 1 – The Solar Cell Invoices</a> appeared first on <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com">Fuzzy Panda Research</a>.</p>
]]></description>
		
		
		
