					<description><![CDATA[<p>Fermi CEO and co-founder Toby Neugebauer “departed” the company Friday -- we believe he was fired -- leaving his loyalists to run the shop. But like Toby, his leftovers in the Fermi C-suite face serious allegations of fraudulent transfers and misappropriation of assets, and lack the experience needed to build a massive AI data center and power project.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/fermi-fraudulent-transfers-no-tenant-ai-hype/">Fermi America (FRMI) &#8211; Matador Trained on Fraudulent Transfers &amp; Drunk on AI Hype Will Slaughter Bulls</a> appeared first on <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com">Fuzzy Panda Research</a>.</p>
]]></description>
		
		
		
