		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/?p=2997</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>NUAI is a Roth SPAC and purported AI data center play whose stock ran up 20x on paid promotions. But it has a CEO with a history of incinerating value at penny stock co's, and we believe it’s going to be the same story at NUAI. Gray failed at his original plan to produce helium, so he slapped "AI" on the ticker and began peddling data center fantasies.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/nuai-ai-paid-stock-promotion-bad-gas-pink-sheets-ceo-failed/">NUAI: Serial Penny Stock CEO Combined Bad Gas Assets, Paid Stock Promo, Renamed Co &amp; Added &#8220;AI&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com">Fuzzy Panda Research</a>.</p>
]]></description>
		
		
		
