		<item>
		<title>Rezolve AI (RZLV): Faking ARR by Acquiring Failing AI Start-ups w/ Declining Revenue; Promotional CEO’s History of False Statements</title>
		<link>https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/rezolve-ai-rzlv-faking-arr-declining-revenue-dan-wagner-chatgpt-wrapper/?utm_source=rss&#038;utm_medium=rss&#038;utm_campaign=rezolve-ai-rzlv-faking-arr-declining-revenue-dan-wagner-chatgpt-wrapper</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Fuzzy Panda Research]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 29 Sep 2025 14:16:40 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Rezolve AI]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AI]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[BTC]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ChatGPT]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ChatGPT Wrapper]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Dan Wagner]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Declining Revenue]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Google]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Kazakhstan]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LLM]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Microsoft]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Russell 2000 Index]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Self-Dealing]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Seychelles]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Shell Company]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/?p=2661</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Rezolve AI is a mobile phone tech company that tried to SPAC and failed in 2021. Management added the letters "AI" to its name in 2023, despite having no AI product, and, low and behold, completed a SPAC in 2024. A bunch of hyped press releases later, and Rezolve reached an ~$2bn valuation even though it had $0 in AI revenue last year. </p>
<p>The post <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/rezolve-ai-rzlv-faking-arr-declining-revenue-dan-wagner-chatgpt-wrapper/">Rezolve AI (RZLV): Faking ARR by Acquiring Failing AI Start-ups w/ Declining Revenue; Promotional CEO’s History of False Statements</a> appeared first on <a href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com">Fuzzy Panda Research</a>.</p>
]]></description>
		
		
		
